# viewing-the-blue-sea.thr  --  Plumb (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-09-28
# after Cao Cao's 'Viewing the Blue Sea' (Jieshi, 207): the sea in uneven swells widening toward the
# shore, and rising out of it the sun (a woven dish), the moon (a ring round its island) and the Silver River
# arching overhead as a braid -- 'as if they came out of it.' A response to the first hand's star-han-river.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.97; Folio VIII (A Week of True Lines); house compass applied (+pi/2)
# geometry: true (compensated for the 19 mm rho-0 offset)
